  "title": "2023 Hobie Mirage Lynx",
  "handle": "2023-hobie-mirage-lynx-1315",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p><span><span><span><span>Financing Available!*</span></span></span></span></p><p><u><a href=\"https://www.peek.com/s/35ca5495-3168-4c4f-a1b7-0218e39abffb/3yb8E\"><span><span><span>Book a FREE On-Water Demo!</span></span></span></a></u></p><p><br />Experience the perfect blend of performance and portability with the 2023 Hobie Mirage Lynx. Designed for adventurers seeking a lightweight yet robust kayak, the Mirage Lynx offers unparalleled maneuverability and speed. With its streamlined hull and the efficient MirageDrive 180 with Kick-Up Fins, you'll glide effortlessly across the water, whether you're exploring serene lakes or navigating coastal waters.</p><p><strong><u>Key Features</u>:</strong></p><ul>\t<li>\t<p><strong>Lightweight Design:</strong> Weighing just 47 lbs, the Mirage Lynx is easy to transport and launch, making it ideal for spontaneous adventures.</p>\t</li>\t<li>\t<p><strong>MirageDrive 180 with Kick-Up Fins:</strong> Enjoy hands-free propulsion in both forward and reverse, allowing for precise control and the ability to navigate shallow waters without worry.</p>\t</li>\t<li>\t<p><strong>Stable and Sleek Hull:</strong> The flat-bottom design ensures stability without compromising speed, providing a smooth and confident ride.</p>\t</li>\t<li>\t<p><strong>Elevated Seating:</strong> Stay dry and comfortable with the breathable, mono-mesh seat, designed for all-day excursions.</p>\t</li>\t<li>\t<p><strong>Accessory-Ready:</strong> Customize your kayak with molded-in tracks and an accessory mount, compatible with Hobie's Sail Kit, Bimini Sunshade, and other upgrades.</p>\t</li></ul><p><br /><strong><u>Specifications</u>:</strong></p><ul>\t<li><strong>Length:</strong> 11' / 3.35 m</li>\t<li><strong>Width:</strong> 36\" / 91.44 cm</li>\t<li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 350 lbs / 158.76 kg</li>\t<li><strong>Fitted Hull Weight:</strong> 47 lbs / 21.32 kg</li>\t<li><strong>Fully Rigged Weight:</strong> 63 lbs / 28.58 kg</li></ul><p><br /><strong><u>Exceptional Value:</u></strong></p><p>Take advantage of our special pricing on the 2023 Hobie Mirage Lynx. Priced at $2,899, you save $100 off the 2025 MSRP of $2,999. Plus, your purchase includes a full 3-year warranty starting from the date of purchase, ensuring peace of mind as you embark on your kayaking adventures.</p><p><span>*Must be approved by Synchrony Financial with a large enough credit line to cover the purchase price. Call (815) 433-2200 for more info</span></p>",
